__get_dde_prefix () measured the DDEUtils prefix with  for (end_prefix = prefix; (unsigned char)*prefix >= ' '; ++end_prefix)  : the test reads *prefix, which never changes, not *end_prefix: when a DDEUtils prefix
is set for the task (*Prefix <dir>, which StrongED, DDE Make and UnixLib's own chdir () use) the loop never ends.  Every UnixLib program starts by calling __get_dde_prefix () (__unixinit, vfork, getcwd).
